  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to excutive office of the Secretary General on Our Common Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects is to provide support to the executive office of the secretary general of the UN to enhance the concretisations of the proposals within and implementation of &quot;Our Common Agenda&quot;. The support is a continuation of previous Norwegian support to the EOSG on the reform agenda and its implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
